West: a mossling warren, and beyond it a hollow where lights float. East: kobolds, and further in, goblins. Up a tunnel in the west wall: an old crypt. Near the head, east: the orc hall. The warlord's temple lies in the rock beyond the head of the gorge, and the way in runs through the orc hall.",[_[36]]="\"WHAT WE KNOW\
West: a mossling warren, and beyond it a hollow where lights float. East: kobolds, and further in, goblins. Up a tunnel in the west wall: an old crypt. Near the head, east: the orc hall. The warlord's temple lies in the rock beyond the head of the gorge, and the way in runs through the orc hall.\"",[_[1]]=_[10]}},name=_[19],z=6,param1=159},{x=43,y=37,name=_[20],z=12,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=34,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=35,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=37,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=38,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=39,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=40,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=41,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=42,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=43,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=44,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=45,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=46,param1=15},{x=43,y=37,name=_[12],z=47,param1=15},{x=43,y=38,name=_[20],z=1,param1=15},{x=43,y=38,name=_[20],z=12,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=0,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=1,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=2,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=3,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=4,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=5,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=6,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=7,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=8,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=9,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=10,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=11,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=12,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=13,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=14,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=15,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=16,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=17,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=18,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=19,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=20,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=21,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=22,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=23,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=24,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=25,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=26,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=27,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[2],z=28,param1=15},{x=44,y=4,name=_[